@startuml
title SD-B07 Reset Password

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam BoxPadding 4
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #333333
    LifeLineBorderColor #999999
    LifeLineBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantBorderColor #999999
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECEEF8
    ParticipantFontColor #111111
    ActorBorderColor #999999
    ActorFontColor #111111
    GroupBorderColor #111111
    GroupBackgroundColor transparent
}

actor "Pengguna" as Pengguna
boundary "Email Reset Password" as EmailReset
boundary "Halaman Reset Password" as HalamanReset
boundary "Form Password Baru" as FormPassword
control "NewPasswordController" as NewPasswordController
entity "PasswordResetToken" as ResetToken
entity "Users Model" as User

Pengguna -> EmailReset : Membuka link reset password
EmailReset -> HalamanReset : buka halaman reset password
HalamanReset --> Pengguna : form reset password tampil
Pengguna -> FormPassword : Mengisi password baru dan konfirmasi
Pengguna -> FormPassword : Klik simpan password baru
FormPassword -> NewPasswordController : store(data reset)
NewPasswordController -> NewPasswordController : validasi email, password,\ndan konfirmasi

alt Data valid
    NewPasswordController -> ResetToken : validasi token reset
    ResetToken --> NewPasswordController : token valid
    NewPasswordController -> User : update password terenkripsi
    User --> NewPasswordController : update berhasil
    NewPasswordController -> ResetToken : hapus token reset
    ResetToken --> NewPasswordController : token terhapus
    NewPasswordController --> HalamanReset : redirect halaman login
    HalamanReset --> Pengguna : password berhasil direset
else Token tidak valid / kedaluwarsa
    NewPasswordController --> FormPassword : tampilkan pesan token tidak valid
    FormPassword --> Pengguna : reset ditolak
else Password tidak valid / konfirmasi tidak cocok
    NewPasswordController --> FormPassword : tampilkan error validasi
    FormPassword --> Pengguna : perbaiki input
end

@enduml
